                                "sense_id": "d9ee7e08-95f9-31b6-9aa1-2a8b5462e61f",
                                "text": "Just how, Agamemnon, great field marshal . . . most grasping man alive, how can the generous Argives give you prizes now? I know of no troves of treasure, piled, lying idle, anywhere."
                            }
                        ]
